  "@type": "Course",
  "name": "Search, State Spaces and Why Symbolic Methods Survive",
  "courseCode": "F2",
  "description": "Search is the oldest idea in AI and the one most often written off as obsolete. It is not: planning loops, constraint solving and verifier-based reasoning are all search, and CS2023 deliberately retains it. You will implement the algorithms rather than read about them.",
  "url": "https://contexai.pk/courses/f2-search-and-state-spaces/",
