    "@type": "EducationalOrganization",
    "name": "ContexAi Academy",
    "sameAs": "https://contexai.org"
  },
  "educationalLevel": "Beginner",
  "teaches": [
    "On successful completion, you will be able to construct a state-space representation of an informal problem.",
    "On successful completion, you will be able to explain why the choice of state representation dominates performance.",
    "On successful completion, you will be able to implement breadth-first search over a state space.",
    "On successful completion, you will be able to compare BFS, DFS and uniform-cost search on completeness and optimality.",
    "On successful completion, you will be able to explain what makes a heuristic admissible and why it matters.",
    "On successful completion, you will be able to evaluate whether a proposed heuristic preserves optimality."
  ],
